## The rule under test

The PM decision of 2026-11-12 states the rule, quoted word for word: "2. Doctor F207: fix it in Phase 3 (due 11-14). doctor.sh counts exit 1 as a boundary verdict only when the CLI output holds its verdict line; exit 1 without that line is a tool failure (gate exit 1). Add the m-cd case."

The base `measure/doctor.sh` maps every exit 1 to a boundary verdict. The Red cases pin the rule of FR-3.

